    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people building this future, which we will get \nto. But first, there are really three reasons  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230400,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why this way of thinking has taken off. The first \nis that even without widespread AI adoption, it's  "
    } ]
  }, {
